{#- Headscale (self-hosted Tailscale control server) with its embedded DERP
   relay, one container (formulas/podman). Pinned tag; Renovate bumps it.

   uid/gid: the container runs as this system account (Podman User=, mapped
   1:1), so data_dir stays owned by it on the host. The matching
   formulas/users account entry (pillar) must use the same numbers.

   Listens on 8443 inside (non-root, no CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE), published on
   https_port. TLS comes from Let's Encrypt via TLS-ALPN-01 on that same
   port — nothing on :80. stun_port: the DERP relay's STUN (udp).

   metrics_host_ip: where the /metrics port is published. Default loopback;
   pillar sets the address Prometheus reaches (on cloud-edge the wg0 IP).

   server_url / base_domain: required (config.sls fails without them).
   base_domain is the MagicDNS suffix and must not be server_url's domain.
   acme_email: optional — empty = Let's Encrypt account without contact.

   policy: the tailnet policy as a dict, rendered to policy.hujson (plain
   JSON is valid HuJSON). Empty = Headscale's default (allow all), so pillar
   should always set one.
   search_domains: pushed to clients as search domains. systemd-resolved
   also routes them: a name below one goes only to the tailnet resolver
   (longest routing domain wins over the other links' `~.`), so a public
   wildcard can't answer for it first.
   extra_records: list of {name, type, value} DNS records for MagicDNS
   clients, rendered to extra-records.json. Config, policy or record changes
   restart the container (the hot reload breaks on Salt's file replace).

   podman: spec overrides for the container (keys: formulas/podman README). #}
{%- set public_resolvers = ['1.1.1.1', '9.9.9.9'] %}{#- secret-scan: allow (public DNS resolvers) #}
{%- set defaults = {
    'image': 'docker.io/headscale/headscale',
    'tag': '0.29.7',
    'container_name': 'headscale',
    'uid': 977,
    'gid': 977,
    'base_dir': '/opt/headscale',
    'config_dir': '/opt/headscale/config',
    'data_dir': '/opt/headscale/data',
    'https_port': 443,
    'stun_port': 3478,
    'metrics_host_ip': '127.0.0.1',
    'metrics_port': 9090,
    'server_url': '',
    'base_domain': '',
    'acme_email': '',
    'nameservers': public_resolvers,
    'node_expiry': '180d',
    'derp_region_id': 999,
    'log_level': 'info',
    'policy': {},
    'search_domains': [],
    'extra_records': [],
    'podman': {},
} %}
{%- set headscale = salt['pillar.get']('headscale:lookup', default=defaults, merge=True) %}
